WEBVTT

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:46.430
Felicitá! Felicitá!

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.650
Open your eyes, Felicitá!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.210
I was too late...

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.660
What's going on?

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:00.880
Princess!

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:04.500
Come on! Open your eyes, my daughter!

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:05.980
Milady!

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.190
What happened?

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:17.740
Felicitá!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.000
Felicitá!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.600
My daughter!

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.420
Daughter, it's me. 
You know who I am, right?

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:34.460
Who are you?

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.090
Milady...

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.430
Mondo!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.690
Papa!

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.700
I wonder what's wrong with Milady.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.280
She seems so out of it lately.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.500
She doesn't reply even 
if we talk to her.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:12.780
It's as though she doesn't 
remember us at all.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.920
Mama, please tell me.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.670
What's happening to Felicitá?

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:27.570
Rather, why has she lost her memory?

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.190
Oh, Miss!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.590
I came to visit you.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:40.940
Miss?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.950
What will you do after finding out?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.970
I would like to be of some help.

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:49.420
Such a sweet child.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.690
Please do not mock me.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.140
The reason that Felicitá is like that

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.830
is because she used the other Taroc—

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.190
Nova.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.420
You don't need to worry about this.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.880
This is something that we, 
her family, need to work out.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.050
I'm sorry.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.270
Well, if it isn't the chickpea.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.310
What do you want?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.490
You're not going to say it?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.500
"Don't call me a chickpea"?

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:35.270
Do you know why Princess 
ended up like that?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.220
Another Tarocco?

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.460
Fel has two Tarocco: The Lovers

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.220
and The Wheel of Fortune.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.750
So she's like that because she 
used The Wheel of Fortune?

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.400
Yeah.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.900
However, that's just my deduction.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.610
But why does she have two Tarocco?

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.730
The only thing I know is that

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:09.160
she was already host to 
the two Tarocco at birth.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.580
At birth?

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.990
I see, so Princess, too...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:15.690
"Princess, too"?

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.460
You're telling me you're the same?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.950
I'm not sure,

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:24.050
but I don't remember ever making 
a contract with The Fool card.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:28.340
Doesn't that mean I've been 
the host since I was born?

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.570
I'm the same.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:35.050
Actually, my mother made the contract

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:36.790
with the Tarocco before I was born.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.320
And instead of making her the host,

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:41.110
it made me the host while 
I was still in her womb.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.580
What is it?

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.450
Felicitá is the daughter 
of Mama and Papa.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.290
I am Papa's nephew.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.240
What are you talking about now?

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.670
It's said that you have 
a higher probability

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.310
of contracting with a Tarocco

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.750
if you are related to 
an existing contractor.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.250
What are you trying to say?

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:04.380
It's possible that you 
may be related to us...

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.520
N-No way. Wait a sec.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.660
Dante picked me up from Nord.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.140
It's just a coinci—

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:22.400
You, Princess and I all had 
Arcana powers at birth.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.400
That could just be coincidence.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.520
But because of that,

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:29.360
we were able to meet as members 
of the Arcana Famiglia.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.340
That's not a coincidence!

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.870
We, the Arcana Famiglia, 
are like a family

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.660
bound together by Arcana 
powers, aren't we?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.800
Why are you bringing this up now?

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.130
This is something that we, 
her family, need to work out.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:53.400
And I don't want to lose 
any member of that family!

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:56.040
I want to get Princess' 
memory back no matter what!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:00.230
I don't like the fact 
that I agree with you,

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.610
but I do.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.470
This concerns all of us.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:11.080
I have an idea.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:16.890
This brings back memories.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.280
That's right,

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.210
you've been here, as well.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.650
I've heard, to have someone 
recall memories,

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:25.300
it's best to take them somewhere

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.340
they made a lot of memories.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.060
Do you remember anything, Princess?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.050
Well then,

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:43.680
I guess I'm just going to have to 
find something that you'll remember.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.690
This is Mama's room.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.380
What's that?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.770
N-N-Nothing!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.550
Come on, let me see it.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:14.990
A ring?

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.310
It's Felicitá's and my 
engagement ring.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:23.250
Oh, so it's your engageme—

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.560
What?!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.500
Engagement ring?!

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.780
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:33.570
More precisely, I was 
asked to hold on to it.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.700
Wait, Milady!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.160
An engagement ring?

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.700
It's the ring that I 
wanted to give my son,

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:45.220
in other words, the one who 
will marry my daughter.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:51.990
I'd like you to give my daughter 
that ring yourself one day.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.830
So why is something like that here?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.100
Because I returned it.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:01.900
What?

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.140
You returned it? Why?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.900
The reason my parents are asleep

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.720
is because I used my powers of Death.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.030
I have no right to be that son

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.100
after I put Papa's older 
brother in that state.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:27.960
I wonder where her memories went.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.790
Where?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.720
I was thinking about getting them back.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.600
I never thought of it that way.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:44.690
Come to think of it, 
it's never been proven

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.430
that memories are ever 
completely destroyed.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:54.670
If they are just sealed away 
somewhere in her heart...

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.740
You fools!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.870
Do you have any idea 
how worried we were?!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.250
Exactly! If something 
were to happen to Mil—

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:13.310
Something's already happened.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:15.780
Dante,

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:20.450
you know the reason Bambina 
lost her memories, don't you?

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.030
But it's not like you'd 
tell us that easily.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.400
I can mostly guess the answer, though.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.730
Then why don't we compare our answers?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.890
Jolly!

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.030
The correct answer is

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.610
I had Milady use The Wheel of Fortune

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:44.110
without telling her that losing her memory 
would be the consequence.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.240
What the hell for, old man?

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.360
For Papa, right?

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:55.750
That's the same reason you had 
us contract with the Tarocco.

00:10:56.900 --> 00:11:01.210
But what would Milady using 
The Wheel of Fortune d—

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.350
To save Mondo.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:15.420
The World card had that 
heavy a consequence?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:18.440
Then, because Princess used 
The Wheel of Fortune card...

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:19.550
Yes.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.990
Because of that, 
Mondo's life has been saved.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:29.760
Despite it being for Papa,

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:33.330
Jolly, what you've done is...

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.970
You used Princess, didn't you?

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.640
You even used Bambina as a tool?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.580
I'm going to kill you, after all.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.160
If you kill me,

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.360
there'll be no chance of Milady 
regaining her memories.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.480
What?

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.860
Your Tarocco is The Moon.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:04.270
The Moon's Arcana power is to 
forcefully bring back memories

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.750
on those it is used on.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.140
However, I have no intention 
of relying on you.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:17.710
I know that you only 
do things for my sake.

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:20.590
Therefore, I can't hold 
a grudge against you.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.050
However...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.180
There's no way I can 
forgive you, either!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.440
Papa.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.550
I can't forgive Jolly for 
what he's done, either.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.620
But if he's the only one 
who can save her...

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.360
Please...

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.400
Let him save Princess with 
his Arcana powers...

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.750
Libertá...

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.830
Papa.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.000
The reason that we, 
the Arcana Famiglia, exist

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.950
is to help those in 
need on Regalo Island,

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.050
by using our Arcana powers.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:01.990
Since that's the case,

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:06.100
it is our duty as a family to bring back

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.470
Felicitá's memories by using 
Jolly's Arcana powers.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.230
Not to mention,

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:16.690
I don't want to lose another family member.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.130
Nova...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.970
I look away for a moment and...

00:13:58.850 --> 00:13:59.850
Jolly.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.120
As the director, I beg of you...

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.570
Save Milady.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.870
What happens if he fails?!

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:20.880
There's no guarantee that this 
will not endanger Milady's life!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.070
There has to be some other way...

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.260
Even if there were, Luca,

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.820
there's no guarantee

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:32.020
that method wouldn't 
endanger her life, either.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.810
I believe we need to 
gamble on this possibility.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:01.000
Luna Piena Sonno.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.140
This is Milady's...

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:26.450
<i>Where?</i>

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.090
<i>Where is it?</i>

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.580
How long is this going to take?

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.730
Was it already destroyed?

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.160
I'll use my Arcana powers

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:16.530
to push yours to their limits.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.040
Look.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.300
This is...

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.300
Felicitá!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.400
Her memories are about to 
be sealed away forever.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.910
Let's go!

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:12.090
Mondo!

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.330
Mondo, that's enough!

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:24.480
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.410
I've come here to retrieve 
something precious to me.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:31.920
But at this rate, 
it'll cost you your life.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:33.890
Mondo!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.250
It doesn't matter if I lose my life!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.370
You're wrong, Papa!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.790
I told you,

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.590
I don't want to lose another family member!

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.090
Family...

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.430
Felicitá!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.650
Papa!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.190
Felicitá.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:20.710
Welcome back, Milady.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:28.170
Thank you for your hard work, Jolly.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:34.160
I'm not the one you should 
be thanking, Mondo.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:42.100
Arcana powers rely on 
emotional strength.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:48.450
It's because of their strong 
feelings reaching Milady...

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.000
I have a wonderful family.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:01.970
This is something that we, 
her family, need to work out.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.380
Libertá, Nova.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.540
Thank you.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.170
Mama.

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:15.830
I'm sorry, Nova.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.250
I said something I never should have

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.200
as the Mama of the Arcana Famiglia.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:23.730
No.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:28.420
That's precisely why I 
was able to realize

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.590
something very important.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.250
You really are a sweet child.

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:39.950
Papa, I think I've realized something.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:43.910
Felicitá had mentioned it before.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:49.360
I wonder why we even 
have Arcana powers.

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:53.910
I believe that we have Arcana powers

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.840
in order to protect those dear to us.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.420
That might be the case.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:03.370
Those dear to us?

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:25.280
Jolly, I must thank you today.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:26.630
Thank you very mu—

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:28.790
There's no need to thank me.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.920
I was merely cleaning up my own mess.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.420
I'm going outside for a bit.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.520
You're saying that the 
relationship between

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.380
Mondo and The World 
card hasn't changed?

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:58.360
What?

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:00.230
But why?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.990
Milady used the powers 
of The Wheel of Fortune.

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.280
It means that Milady was 
not able to fully use

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:10.940
The Wheel of Fortune in her 
current emotional state.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.000
Then Mondo...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.520
I'm not able to save Papa?

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.080
You lack heart.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:27.540
If you have the strong desire,

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.710
I will provide the emotional power

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.740
that The Wheel of Fortune requires.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:39.030
And that shall negate 
The Wheel of Fortune's consequences.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:43.100
You're Gli Amanti...

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:46.350
To establish Gli Amanti, The Lovers,

00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:49.020
you must have someone else.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:52.520
Love cannot be completed 
with you alone.

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:59.990
Love cannot be completed with me alone?

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:34.140
Libertá, don't walk! You must run!

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:34.810
Wha?

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.850
You are part of the 
Don't Walk (Arukanai) Famiglia.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.460
Just kidding!

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:40.690
Right...
